; Module: qemu_lightning.opengl.reactos_sync_imports_amd64
; Purpose: Link the existing Mesa synchronization calls to ReactOS AMD64's helper DLL.
; Created: 2026-10-24
; Architecture: x64 has one calling convention and undecorated names; same exports as i386.
LIBRARY kernel32_vista.dll
EXPORTS
AcquireSRWLockExclusive
AcquireSRWLockShared
InitOnceExecuteOnce
InitializeSRWLock
ReleaseSRWLockExclusive
ReleaseSRWLockShared
